    "sections": {
        "description": "Ona Studio is a block WordPress theme for full site editing. It's a child theme of a popular Ona theme. This theme is perfect for design studios, freelancers, creative professionals &amp; agencies agencies, startups, small and local business companies. Ona Studio theme enhances your website with a modern transparent header navbar and unique masonry grids. With its clean, minimal design aesthetic, Ona Studio puts your content center stage while delivering a seamless user experience. Whether you're building a striking portfolio or establishing your business presence, Ona Studio provides the perfect canvas for your digital story. Its intuitive block-based structure ensures complete creative control while maintaining professional polish across every page. Customize header, footer or post layout using advanced drag and drop WordPress site editor, no page builders required."
    },
